<dd id="mwPA"><i id="mwPQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NBA_play-in_tournament" title="NBA play-in tournament" id="mwPg">Play-in games</a> do not count as a playoff game or series.</i></dd></dl>

