<ul id="mwB1I"><li id="mwB1M"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt320" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwB1Q" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note3"},"2":{"wt":"a"},"3":{"wt":"a"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note3a" about="#mwt320"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note3a" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>a</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt320"> </span> The Sacramento Kings last appeared in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1951_NBA_Finals" title="1951 NBA Finals" id="mwB1U">1951 NBA Finals</a> as the Rochester Royals. Predates NBA-ABA merger.</li>
<li id="mwB1Y"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt322" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwB1c" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note4"},"2":{"wt":"b"},"3":{"wt":"b"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note4b" about="#mwt322"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note4b" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>b</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt322"> </span> The Atlanta Hawks last appeared in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1961_NBA_Finals" title="1961 NBA Finals" id="mwB1g">1961 NBA Finals</a> as the St. Louis Hawks. Predates NBA-ABA merger.</li>
<li id="mwB1k"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt324" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwB1o" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note5"},"2":{"wt":"c"},"3":{"wt":"c"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note5c" about="#mwt324"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note5c" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>c</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt324"> </span> The Washington Wizards last appeared in the 1979 Conference Finals and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1979_NBA_Finals" title="1979 NBA Finals" id="mwB1s">NBA Finals</a> as the Washington Bullets.</li>
<li id="mwB1w"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt326" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwB10" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note6"},"2":{"wt":"d"},"3":{"wt":"d"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note6d" about="#mwt326"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note6d" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>d</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt326"> </span> The Brooklyn Nets last appeared in the 2003 Conference Finals and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_NBA_Finals" title="2003 NBA Finals" id="mwB14">NBA Finals</a> as the New Jersey Nets.</li></ul>

