<ul id="mwCOs"><li id="mwCOw"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt400" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCO0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note13"},"2":{"wt":"a"},"3":{"wt":"a"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note13a" about="#mwt400"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note13a" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>a</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt400"> </span> The Sacramento Kings last won an NBA championship in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1951_NBA_Finals" title="1951 NBA Finals" id="mwCO4">1951</a> as the Rochester Royals.</li>
<li id="mwCO8"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt402" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCPA" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note14"},"2":{"wt":"b"},"3":{"wt":"b"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note14b" about="#mwt402"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note14b" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>b</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt402"> </span> The Atlanta Hawks last won an NBA championship in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1958_NBA_Finals" title="1958 NBA Finals" id="mwCPE">1958</a> as the St. Louis Hawks.</li>
<li id="mwCPI"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt404" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCPM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note15"},"2":{"wt":"c"},"3":{"wt":"c"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note15c" about="#mwt404"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note15c" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>c</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt404"> </span> Predates the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NBA-ABA_merger" title="NBA-ABA merger" class="mw-redirect" id="mwCPQ">NBA-ABA merger</a>.</li>
<li id="mwCPU"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt406" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCPY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note16"},"2":{"wt":"d"},"3":{"wt":"d"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note16d" about="#mwt406"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note16d" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>d</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt406"> </span> The Washington Wizards last won an NBA championship in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1978_NBA_Finals" title="1978 NBA Finals" id="mwCPc">1978</a> as the Washington Bullets.</li></ul>

