</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwCiw" aria-labelledby="Closest_approaches_without_winning"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Closest_approaches_without_winning">Closest approaches without winning</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_NBA_franchise_postseason_droughts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Closest approaches without winning"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

