<ul id="mwDhk"><li id="mwDho"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt710" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwDhs" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note38"},"2":{"wt":"a"},"3":{"wt":"a"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note38a" about="#mwt710"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note38a" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>a</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt710"> </span> Streak includes seasons as Buffalo Braves and San Diego Clippers.</li>
<li id="mwDhw"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt712" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwDh0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note39"},"2":{"wt":"b"},"3":{"wt":"b"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note39b" about="#mwt712"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note39b" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>b</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt712"> </span> Team last qualified for the Conference Finals as Washington Bullets.</li>
<li id="mwDh4"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt714" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwDh8" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note41"},"2":{"wt":"c"},"3":{"wt":"c"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note41c" about="#mwt714"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note41c" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>c</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt714"> </span> Franchise inactive for two seasons between 2002 and 2004.</li>
<li id="mwDiA"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt716" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwDiE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note40"},"2":{"wt":"d"},"3":{"wt":"d"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note40d" about="#mwt716"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note40d" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>d</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt716"> </span> Current Brooklyn Nets; includes one season as New York Nets.</li>
<li id="mwDiI"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt718" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwDiM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"note label","href":"./Template:Note_label"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Note42"},"2":{"wt":"e"},"3":{"wt":"e"}},"i":0}}]}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_Note42e" about="#mwt718"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_Note42e" class="mw-selflink-fragment"><b><sup>e</sup></b></a></span><span about="#mwt718"> </span> Includes four seasons as Kansas City Kings.</li></ul>

