</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="15" id="mwD00" aria-labelledby="Finals_droughts"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Finals_droughts">Finals droughts</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_NBA_franchise_postseason_droughts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section: Finals droughts"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="16" id="mwD04" aria-labelledby="NBA_Finals_in_which_neither_team_had_previously_won_a_championship"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="NBA_Finals_in_which_neither_team_had_previously_won_a_championship">NBA Finals in which neither team had previously won a championship</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_NBA_franchise_postseason_droughts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16" title="Edit section: NBA Finals in which neither team had previously won a championship"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwD08">In these instances, the matchup ensured that one team would win the first NBA championship in its history.</p>

